{"id":"5f6999282aa3dc01","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-higher-order-terms.md","title":"长正规高阶项","display":"df-higher-order-terms — 长正规高阶项","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-higher-order-terms","aliases":["56-df-higher-order-terms"],"display":"df-higher-order-terms — 长正规高阶项","depends_on":["[[56-df-position]]","[[56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence]]","[[56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization]]","[[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus]]","[[56-df-beta-reduction]]","[[56-df-relation-closure]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definitions 11.2.10–11.2.16 and Propositions 11.2.11,11.2.15, printed pp593–595","source_ocr_block":"614–616","source_status":"statements-and-proof-outlines-compared; normalization-used-as-source-result"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-higher-order-terms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-higher-order-terms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-higher-order-terms — 长正规高阶项"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d344b982e3ec8df3\" href=\"?note=d344b982e3ec8df3\" title=\"56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence\">56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"24bd3576f4c5852a\" href=\"?note=24bd3576f4c5852a\" title=\"56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization\">56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"884fb16496d08ed1\" href=\"?note=884fb16496d08ed1\" title=\"56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus\">56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"650401013847f443\" href=\"?note=650401013847f443\" title=\"56-df-beta-reduction\">56-df-beta-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definitions 11.2.10–11.2.16 and Propositions 11.2.11,11.2.15, printed pp593–595"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"614–616"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statements-and-proof-outlines-compared; normalization-used-as-source-result"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"884fb16496d08ed1\" href=\"?note=884fb16496d08ed1\" title=\"56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus\">56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Typ},\\mathcal B,V_A,F,\\tau_V,\\tau_F,\\Lambda_A,E_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Typ},\\mathcal B,V_A,F,\\tau_V,\\tau_F,\\Lambda_A,E_\\tau\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\tau_V\\cup\\tau_F\">\\(\\tau=\\tau_V\\cup\\tau_F\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathcal B\">\\(b\\in\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。原始项集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)\">\\(L=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{n,A}\">\\(H_{n,A}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_A^{\\mathrm{raw}}\">\\(H_A^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_A\">\\(H_A\\)</span> 再取同类型 α 商。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq_A\">\\(\\simeq_A\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d344b982e3ec8df3\" href=\"?note=d344b982e3ec8df3\" title=\"56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence\">56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence</a> 的固定类型 βη 转换；强正规化含固定类型惰性常元，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"24bd3576f4c5852a\" href=\"?note=24bd3576f4c5852a\" title=\"56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization\">56-thm-simply-typed-strong-normalization</a>。箭头串向右结合，空输入类型串以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 为值；零参数应用以头本身为值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_\\lambda=\\{1,2\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(W_\\lambda=\\{1,2\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon=()\">\\(\\epsilon=()\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span> 为串连接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq\">\\(\\preceq\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a> 的前缀关系。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,P,Q\\in L\">\\(M,N,P,Q\\in L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in V\\cup F\">\\(h\\in V\\cup F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec N=(N_1,\\ldots,N_k)\\in L^k\">\\(\\vec N=(N_1,\\ldots,N_k)\\in L^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in W_\\lambda\">\\(p\\in W_\\lambda\\)</span>；子项取值仅在已量化的合法出现位置上调用。常元分支的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 仅在该分支遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\varnothing\">\\(F=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_{0,A}\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_{0,A}\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_{n+1,b}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\ \\bigcup_{(A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\\in\\mathrm{Typ}^k}\n\\left\\{hM_1\\cdots M_k:\nh\\in V\\cup F,\\ \\tau(h)=A_1\\Rightarrow\\cdots\\Rightarrow A_k\\Rightarrow b,\\\n(M_1,\\ldots,M_k)\\in\\prod_{i=1}^{k}H_{n,A_i}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_{n+1,b}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\ \\bigcup_{(A_1,\\ldots,A_k)\\in\\mathrm{Typ}^k}\n\\left\\{hM_1\\cdots M_k:\nh\\in V\\cup F,\\ \\tau(h)=A_1\\Rightarrow\\cdots\\Rightarrow A_k\\Rightarrow b,\\\n(M_1,\\ldots,M_k)\\in\\prod_{i=1}^{k}H_{n,A_i}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_{n+1,A\\Rightarrow B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\lambda x.M:x\\in V_A,\\ M\\in H_{n,B}\\},\\qquad\nH_A^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}H_{n,A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_{n+1,A\\Rightarrow B}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\lambda x.M:x\\in V_A,\\ M\\in H_{n,B}\\},\\qquad\nH_A^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}H_{n,A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_A\\coloneqq\\{[M]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}:M\\in H_A^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\},\\qquad\nH\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}}H_A,\\qquad\n\\bar h\\coloneqq[h]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_A\\coloneqq\\{[M]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}:M\\in H_A^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\},\\qquad\nH\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}}H_A,\\qquad\n\\bar h\\coloneqq[h]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_A\\subseteq\\Lambda_A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_A\\subseteq\\Lambda_A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall M\\in\\Lambda_A\\;\\exists!N\\in H_A\\;(M\\simeq_A N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall M\\in\\Lambda_A\\;\\exists!N\\in H_A\\;(M\\simeq_A N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu_A\\coloneqq\\{(M,N)\\in\\Lambda_A\\times H_A:M\\simeq_A N\\},\\qquad\n\\nu_A:\\Lambda_A\\to H_A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu_A\\coloneqq\\{(M,N)\\in\\Lambda_A\\times H_A:M\\simeq_A N\\},\\qquad\n\\nu_A:\\Lambda_A\\to H_A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Occ}(x)\\coloneqq\\{\\epsilon\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Occ}(f)\\coloneqq\\{\\epsilon\\}\\quad(f\\in F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Occ}(x)\\coloneqq\\{\\epsilon\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Occ}(f)\\coloneqq\\{\\epsilon\\}\\quad(f\\in F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Occ}(MN)\\coloneqq\\{\\epsilon\\}\\cup\n\\{(1)\\cdot p:p\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(M)\\}\\cup\n\\{(2)\\cdot p:p\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(N)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Occ}(MN)\\coloneqq\\{\\epsilon\\}\\cup\n\\{(1)\\cdot p:p\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(M)\\}\\cup\n\\{(2)\\cdot p:p\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(N)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Occ}(\\lambda x.M)\\coloneqq\\{\\epsilon\\}\\cup\n\\{(1)\\cdot p:p\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Occ}(\\lambda x.M)\\coloneqq\\{\\epsilon\\}\\cup\n\\{(1)\\cdot p:p\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M|_\\epsilon\\coloneqq M,\\qquad\n(MN)|_{(1)\\cdot p}\\coloneqq M|_p\\quad(p\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(M)),\\qquad\n(MN)|_{(2)\\cdot p}\\coloneqq N|_p\\quad(p\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(N)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M|_\\epsilon\\coloneqq M,\\qquad\n(MN)|_{(1)\\cdot p}\\coloneqq M|_p\\quad(p\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(M)),\\qquad\n(MN)|_{(2)\\cdot p}\\coloneqq N|_p\\quad(p\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(N)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\lambda x.M)|_{(1)\\cdot p}\\coloneqq M|_p\n\\quad(p\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(M)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\lambda x.M)|_{(1)\\cdot p}\\coloneqq M|_p\n\\quad(p\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(M)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bind}(M,p)\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in V:\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(M)\\;\\exists P\\in L\\;\n(M|_q=\\lambda x.P\\land q\\cdot(1)\\preceq p)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Bind}(M,p)\\coloneqq\n\\{x\\in V:\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(M)\\;\\exists P\\in L\\;\n(M|_q=\\lambda x.P\\land q\\cdot(1)\\preceq p)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Spine}(M,p,h,\\vec N)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(M)\\;\\Bigl(p=q\\land M|_q=hN_1\\cdots N_k\\land\n\\neg\\exists r\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(M)\\;\\exists P,Q\\in L\\;\n(q=r\\cdot(1)\\land M|_r=PQ)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Spine}(M,p,h,\\vec N)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists q\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(M)\\;\\Bigl(p=q\\land M|_q=hN_1\\cdots N_k\\land\n\\neg\\exists r\\in\\operatorname{Occ}(M)\\;\\exists P,Q\\in L\\;\n(q=r\\cdot(1)\\land M|_r=PQ)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原文件对 Definitions 11.2.10–11.2.16 的定位。此次补齐内部依赖：固定类型的 βη 收缩有唯一短正规形；长项的定义独立于规范化函数，因此不存在用 ν 定义自身值域的循环。</p>\n<p>存在性可以从短正规形构造。β 正规项要么是抽象，要么具有唯一的变量或常元头及有限参数脊。在抽象体和现有参数上按严格子项递归处理；中性项若仍具有箭头类型，就取同类型新变量，加入应用并抽象它，直到结果为基本类型。新加入的变量再按其类型展开；这些递归只进入原类型的严格子类型。原有子项的有限结构与新变量的有限类型结构保证该过程结束，产物属于某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{n,A}\">\\(H_{n,A}\\)</span>；各步仅使用 α 改名与 η 转换，因此与原项处于同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq_A\">\\(\\simeq_A\\)</span> 类。</p>\n<p>唯一性在 α 商上成立：对 β 正规项作 η 收缩仍为 β 正规；把任一结构长项 η 收缩到短正规形后，按其固定类型重新展开，会恢复原长项的 α 类。这个恢复性质按头参数结构与类型结构归纳，新增绑定变量的不同选择仅产生同类型 α 等价。因此同一短正规形只能对应一个长项类。内部短正规形唯一性遂给出断言中的存在唯一量词，函数图 ν 因而确为全函数。</p>\n<p>Occ、Bind、Spine 只在有限原始代表元上计算。Spine 排除应用的左孩子位置，以便每个头只在其完整应用脊处被检查；父位置显式限于已有出现位置。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence","status":"resolved","id":"d344b982e3ec8df3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-typed-beta-eta-confluence]]","embed":false},{"target":"5